1 NAME Osmund Jensson /Madland/
2 GIVN Osmund Jensson
2 SURN Madland
2 _MARNM Madland
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1707
2 PLAC Nedrebø i Lysefjorden
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 1784
