1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * g. og æ. i Høyland,  s. 276, nr. 42c
2 CONT
2 CONT To America 1854.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/126100723/john-evenson
2 CONT
2 CONT John Evenson (aka Joakim Eivindson Lura) was born in Sandnes, Rogaland, Norway. He immigrated to the United States, arriving in 1854.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married first, Malena. To this union the following children are known to have been born. Malena died in 1878.
2 CONT 1) Edward J. Evenson (Apr 1862-1913)
2 CONT 2) Joseph Evenson (1864-1951)
2 CONT 3) Martin Evenson (abt 1866-15 Oct 1950)
2 CONT 4) Jorgine M. Evenson (1867-1873)
2 CONT 5) Alfred Evenson (1870-1874)
2 CONT 6) John Evenson (7 Jan 1872-)
2 CONT 7) Rev. Alfred J. Evenson (8 Mar 1874-22 Jan 1950; burial Sherman, Minnehaha county, South Dakota)
2 CONT
2 CONT John married second, Bertha Marie Lura on Jan. 29, 1880, in Roland, Story County, Iowa. To this union the following children were born.
2 CONT 1) Bertha Malene Evenson (Mrs. Ross Olson) (Dec 1880-1903)
2 CONT 2) Josephine Marie Evenson (Mrs. William Alfred Cunningham)(1883-1946)
2 CONT 3) Harry Edwin Evenson (Oct 1884-1962)
2 CONT 4) Clara Adeline Evenson (Mrs. A. M. Cory)(Aug 1887-1977)
2 CONT 5) Benford Walter Evenson (Apr 1890-1951)
2 CONT 6) Lunora Evenson (Mrs. Roy Lockhart)(1 Dec 1892-18 Dec 1986, Los Angeles, Calif.)
2 CONT 7) Orville Luther Evenson (Dec 1895-1960)
2 CONT 8) Elmira Evenson (Mrs. Andrew Alvestad) (Nov 1898-1991)
2 CONT 9) Teresa Mildred Evenson (1990-1997)
