2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-436002921-1-501062/tiol-olsen-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-0fc2f8b8647d019948dbea8d215c6ac5&mrid=e81856e2b2b73c2314720949eb5dcfbe MyHeritage Family 
