2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Sawyer BIRTH	Dec 1793 Strand, Strand kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway DEATH	22 Apr 1881 (aged 87) Leland, LaSalle County, Illinois, USA BURIAL	 Little Indian Creek Cemetery Leland, LaSalle County, Illinois, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband, Ole Jonsen, died in Norway on Dec. 22, 1831, leaving her a widow of eight children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha and her daughter,Lena,immigrated to America in April 1853. Her four sons, Thore, Knud, Rasmus, and Ole had come to America in 1846.  Another of her sons, Jonas, immigrated in 1848. Her daughter, Martha, came in 1849. Her la
2 CONC st daughter to immigrate was Berthe and her husband John O.Johnson.  They came in 1856.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband:  Ole Johnson  B. Jan. 1792. D. Dec. 11, 1831 Norway
