2 CONT
2 CONT Jonas immigrated to America in 1848.  He was not married.  His sister-in-law was Melinda Sawyer nee Govig who is also buried in Baker Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT His father, Ole Jonsen, died Dec. 22, 1831, leaving his wife a widow of eight children.  His mother, Martha Sawyer, immigrated to America in 1853.  She died in 1881 and is buried in the Little Indian Creek Cemetery.
