1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tobias and two companions, trying to get home up the mountain, died when the horse whose tail they were clinging to lost his footing on a frozen creek. One survived, but the other two plummeted to their deaths. Aft
2 CONC er he died, his wife Else was pregnant with a child so gave her two year old daughter to his sister, Elizabet and her husband Martin Larsson.
