1 NAME Ole Andreas Omundson
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 MAR 1841
2 PLAC Myklebust
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 28 MAR 1841
2 PLAC Tjora
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
