1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth Stavanger 1884 No. 198: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/1688/248
2 CONT
2 CONT Ungkarl og matros oppgitt født 1877 da sønnen Andreas ble døpt i St. Petri kirke, Stavanger i 1903 No. 13: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/1755/20, og her er foreldrenes oppgitte fødselsår byttet om: https://media.digitalarki
2 CONC vet.no/view/6344/134  To av fadderne var slakter Johan Stangeland og hans kone Anna Stangeland. Det var nok Gerhard sin eldste bror Lars Johan Stangeland f. 2 aug. 1869, d. 2 okt. 1961 og hans kone Anna Kristine Stangeland (f. Kri
2 CONC stensen) f. 11 juli 1872, d. 25 jan. 1944, begge gravlagt på Eiganes gravplass i Stavanger.
2 CONT
2 CONT To America.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/130310924/george-stangeland
2 CONT
2 CONT George Stangeland BIRTH	1 Oct 1884 Norway DEATH	10 Oct 1958 (aged 74) Adams, Jefferson County, New York, USA BURIAL	 Greenlawn Cemetery Warners, Onondaga County, New York, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Syracuse (NY) Post-Standard Sunday, October 12, 1958 Page 28, Column 6
2 CONT
2 CONT Services Monday For Stangeland
2 CONT
2 CONT ADAMS – Services for George Stangeland, 74, of Adams, who died Friday at his home, will be at 10:30 a.m. Monday at the Piddock Funeral Home. Burial will be at 2 p.m. in Greenlawn Memorial Park at Warners.
2 CONT
2 CONT A native of Norway, Mr. Stangeland had been a restaurant operator and chef at Syracuse from 1904 to 1947 when he and his wife retired and moved here to operate the Shady Rest Motel and Restaurant
2 CONT
