2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/176562827/marie-erickson
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Stangeland Erickson BIRTH	6 Dec 1891 Norway DEATH	26 Mar 1987 (aged 95) Sun City, Maricopa County, Arizona, USA BURIAL	 Sunland Memorial Park Sun City, Maricopa County, Arizona, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Erickson was born in Stavanger, Rogaland, Norway, a daughter of Andreas Kristiansen Stangeland 1850–1944 and Gunvor Maria Tingboe 1850–1935. She had siblings Nils Johan Larsen 1869–1944 (Wrong, her brother was Lars Johan Sta
2 CONC ngeland 1869-1961, lived in Stavanger), Bertel Kristian 1871–?, Peder Andreas 1873–1968, Maren Kirstine 1875–?, Anna 1877–?, Gina Marie 1882–1991, Gerhard "George" 1884–1958, Alfred Andreas 1887–?, Carl 1889–1982, Gina Marie 1891–
2 CONC 1991 San Francisco, Samuel Kristiansen 1897–? and Karl 1899–1975.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie immigrated in about 1911 and settled in Syracuse, New York where she was a maid in 1915.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie married Alfred Julius Erickson, an immigrant from Sweden, in 1917 in Syracuse. They had a daughter Alice Marie 1919–2014.
2 CONT
2 CONT The family lived in Syracuse where Alfred owned an automobile painting, body and fender repair business for many years. Marie was a sales clerk in 1940, likely for the business.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred and Marie moved to Arizona in 1961.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie's survivors include her daughter, Alice Burke; two grandchildren; and three great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
